<title>USA: Minn.-St. Paul., Minn. $15 mln won by Harris.</title>
<headline>Minn.-St. Paul., Minn. $15 mln won by Harris.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $15 million of Minneapolis-St. Paul Metropolitan Council, Minn., general obligation transit bonds, Series 1996 D, with a true intercent.</p>
